      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002000740068006500720065002C002000410069006D0061006E0074002E00200048006F007720190072006500200079006F0075002000670065007400740069006E00670020006F006E003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! Sorry, sir! You see, these little guys just...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002100200053006F007200720079002C0020007300690072002100200059006F00750020007300650065002C0020007400680065007300650020006C006900740074006C0065002000670075007900730020006A007500730074002E002E002E00100002011401590000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, now, look at all those Beldum. Lucky you!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002C0020006E006F0077002C0020006C006F006F006B00200061007400200061006C006C002000740068006F00730065002000420065006C00640075006D002E0020004C00750063006B007900200079006F007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See, Beldum are made of magnets. They love the\nelectromagnetic waves that Holovators emit.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It means you got the Holovator up and running\njust fine! Guess I’ll head back to my post, then.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Does that mean...these Beldum are here because\nthey took a shine to the Holovator I repaired...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bel bel!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420065006C002000620065006C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y’know, I bet having these Beldum around would\nmake it a cinch to tell when a Holovator’s broken!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All right, new plan: I’m gonna catch these rascals\nand make them my partners!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Phew... I caught all four of the Beldum, and now\nwe can get back to work!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Check it out! Remember those Beldum I caught?\nThey evolved into these Metang!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI can’t imagine repairin’ Holovators without my\nhandy little helpers here.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 160
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, look at this! Those Beldum I caught have\nfinally evolved all the way into a Metagross!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI can’t believe how big it got... And it still can’t get\nenough of my Holovator repair work!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕř",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
